    "source_notes": [
      {
        "text": "Read the Gemma3 vision, component-model, independently sized MLP, image-sizing and precomputed-RoPE ancestor entries. They establish the existing multimodal container/component interfaces, projector output sizing, image-alignment helper and position-indexed angle-table mechanism reused here.",
