          "call_584036b8ccc4456da3f4a270bbf2a649"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The earlier image-sizing overflow remains in the unchanged helper and now has an integrated Mistral3 caller. The earlier RoPE row-bound omission also remains. The inspected reference head dimensions, 64 and 128, avoid the recorded warp-padding case, and this architecture supplies no fused Q/K normalization weights. Ordinary MLP's unsupported-activation omission remains unchanged, but the new projector selects its implemented GELU branch.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_0035c45b902448e4b3b28252bf05770f",
          "call_36539a2c2a5d44d4a63f2dc53dae6b66",
          "call_531e028617cd4572a2e0fbdd300756ee",
          "call_3e30be17b6284c9b95e8ae7daa523b29",
          "call_54232fc7e3db4e4daec08c4223fc08a1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The component-model ancestor's Qwen3 MoE migration observation is no longer present in the inspected parent constructor: it already supplies a text-component dictionary. This task leaves that constructor unchanged.",
        "basis": "source",
        "evidence": [
          "call_ee3c3fcc77aa492c95e05fa7cdede889",
