        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "PR #25, \u201cLanguage layers for Mistral Small 3.1 and InternVL3,\u201d proposes language-layer support; turboderp's response favors component-aware multimodal support over language-only patches. Its relationship to this task is inferred from the exact Mistral3 architecture identifier and the new component mapping, not an explicit commit reference.",
        "basis": "inference",
        "evidence": [
          "call_00db62ede54642e09d60fe7b31b1fc92",
