        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Other inspected discussions have only inferred source-path connections: #6, \u201cNo ROCm runtime is found, using ROCM_HOME='/usr',\u201d and #7, \u201cquantizing model: undefined symbol: __cxa_call_terminate,\u201d report installation/import failures; #4, \u201cchore: update config.py,\u201d corrects spelling; #29, \u201cAuto-YaRN for Qwen3? Maybe even set it dynamically?,\u201d discusses scaling policy. None establishes a Mistral3 failure addressed here.",
        "basis": "inference",
        "evidence": [
          "call_f79e7a261b714710af26c5b458a308ad",
          "call_e372c8cbeb1445fcad00e7ebeebaa456",
