      },
      {
        "text": "The inspected opening of PR #26, \u201cSuperior 3INST parameters,\u201d concerns decoder multipliers. Issue #33, \u201cError converting model,\u201d reports a compiler tensor-loading failure; #34, \u201ctorch._C._LinAlgError on last layer of quant,\u201d and #42, \u201cconverting to 3.0 bpw causes error; block state has 0 inf values and 34 NaN values,\u201d report quantization failures. Connections here are inferred from shared linear.py or compile.py paths, not evidence that this architecture addition fixes those reports.",
